# ===== ARC-0026 stage 3 — Aeolus' Bag, the winds, The Calm, the Awakening (WB11–WB15, WB22–WB25, WB48) =====
# Texts: approved (00_texts.md C, D1–D3, E). Values: 25 FEAT_Unbound_AeolusBag, SPL_Unbound_TheCalm,
# FEAT_Unbound_AspectAwakening. The rules live in 22_goal_fool.txt (Osiris): the stats below are the pieces it moves.
# Ranks (Gale, Storm, Hurricane) and the bag's level-2 marker passive are created in 30_ranks_cards.patch; the
# structure script grants them. After --apply: lua/CardDB.patch (stage 3 lines) and the goal copy.

# --- The bag (bonus action, a container: one child per wind; Hurricane offers the pairs instead).
# Ready = Osiris puts ARCANA_BAG_READY on her while she has a Windswept enemy; Open = while a wind blows.
@loca WB_BAG_NAME Aeolus' Bag
@loca WB_BAG_DESC Untie the bag of winds and release one of them over the battle. It blows for 1 turn for each <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARCANA_WINDSWEPT">Windswept</LSTag> enemy, and every mark is swept away.
@loca WB_BAG_EXTRA While a wind blows, the bag stays shut, and at the start of your turn the wind sweeps every Windswept mark away. Your allies ride its tailwind; Windswept enemies face its headwind.
@loca WB_BAG_BOREAS Aeolus' Bag: Boreas
@loca WB_BAG_BOREAS_DESC Release Boreas, the North Wind. Your allies move faster, and Windswept enemies are slowed.
@loca WB_BAG_NOTUS Aeolus' Bag: Notus
@loca WB_BAG_NOTUS_DESC Release Notus, the South Wind. Rain and fog cloak your allies from ranged attacks, and Windswept enemies falter on their Saving Throws.
@loca WB_BAG_EURUS Aeolus' Bag: Eurus
@loca WB_BAG_EURUS_DESC Release Eurus, the East Wind. Your allies strike truer, and Windswept enemies' attacks go astray.
@loca WB_BAG_PAIR_BN Aeolus' Bag: Boreas and Notus
@loca WB_BAG_PAIR_BE Aeolus' Bag: Boreas and Eurus
@loca WB_BAG_PAIR_NE Aeolus' Bag: Notus and Eurus
@loca WB_BAG_PAIR_DESC Release two winds at once. Both blow for the same turns.
