# --- The Calm (Aspect card, Tier I; action; only while a wind blows). Its gusts are applied by Osiris (one status per
# remaining turn count R, 1–5); the spell itself only spends the action.
@loca WB_CALM_NAME The Calm
@loca WB_CALM_DESC Still the wind at once. Each turn it had left becomes a gust that strikes every <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARCANA_WINDSWEPT">Windswept</LSTag> enemy for [1], and the bag can be opened again.
@loca WB_CALM_EXTRA Can only be used while a wind blows. Every Windswept mark is swept away.
new entry "Shout_Arcana_Created_TheCalm"
