# --- The Awakening: texts and tiers (E1–E5). The old tier bonuses go (no ability bonus, WB24); the goal does the rest.
@loca h76abef56g542egceedg9549gf86ef239edc5 Release <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ARCANA_WINDSWEPT">Windswept</LSTag> marks with the wind to awaken the Aspect of Curiosity until combat ends. Every mark the wind sweeps away counts - when you open the bag, at the start of each turn it blows, and with The Calm. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>Level 3: release 3 marks to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_I">The First Step</LSTag> and <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Arcana_Created_TheCalm">The Calm</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: release 5 marks to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_II">Fellow Travellers</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: release 8 marks to awaken <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Fool_III">Into the Storm</LSTag>.<br><br>The Awakening status shows how much is left to the next tier.
@loca hb0c9372cg8418g080dg046cg61d05ca39723 The First Step
@loca h5f2ec141gf782gfaeag0976g4dd84ea7176d Once per turn, a Zephyr Strike that carries you to an enemy doesn't cost a bonus action.
@loca h8451466fg943fg2766g54bbge5811a2ba1a9 Fellow Travellers
@loca hd61170aagfbdeg9e94g39f3gab4d01140c21 Your allies' hits also make enemies Windswept.
@loca hb6f88d63g8e4fg7022gb6fag9bfa869369c6 Into the Storm
@loca hd927c9e2gb38ega2c3gb9f5g7e9604a31909 Each time the wind sweeps the marks away, every swept enemy is pushed back [1] and becomes <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="OFF_BALANCED">Off Balance</LSTag>.
@loca h5aa211b3g50d8gd054g2146g6b9097806a16 The First Step: Once per turn, a Zephyr Strike that carries you to an enemy doesn't cost a bonus action.<br><br>Only active while not wearing armour or using a shield.
@loca hc98e7379g11e3gb428g4681g9f94f5551213 The First Step: Once per turn, a Zephyr Strike that carries you to an enemy doesn't cost a bonus action.<br>Fellow Travellers: Your allies' hits also make enemies Windswept.<br><br>Only active while not wearing armour or using a shield.
@loca h0d5de297g3e6egdc22gc822gf7519e223fc6 The First Step: Once per turn, a Zephyr Strike that carries you to an enemy doesn't cost a bonus action.<br>Fellow Travellers: Your allies' hits also make enemies Windswept.<br>Into the Storm: Each time the wind sweeps the marks away, every swept enemy is pushed back and becomes Off Balance.<br><br>Only active while not wearing armour or using a shield.
@loca he80cdc45g60adg8d77g50f5g626fd82b42a4 The First Step
@loca h4b9d78b5g0ee3g2d1eg65e8g48fd9771f335 Your next Zephyr Strike that carries you to an enemy this turn doesn't cost a bonus action.
